+## OpenStorm .182 typed translation receivers
+
+Translation locale and replacement-placeholder completion supports typed
+Translator/contract instances, null-safe receivers and compatible unions. Key
+completion uses the same proof across return/assignment prefixes and comments;
+foreign, scalar or incompatible union peers cannot authorize Laravel suggestions.
+Unfinished arguments recover a local prefix context without publishing synthetic
+declarations or seeding shared resolved-class caches. Existing helper/facade
+identity, argument binding and UTF-16 full-token edits remain unchanged.
+
 ## OpenStorm .181 translation argument callable identity
 
 Locale and replacement-placeholder completion now shares the key-navigation
